Warning [L0532] (zero_divisor): This `/%` always divides by zero
  --> zero_divisor.jet:6:14
    |
  6 |     whole :: n /% 0
    |              ^^^^^^
 Why: The divisor folds to 0 at compile time, so every run of this line stops with E3010 (divided by zero)
 Fix: Divide by a value that can't be zero, or check the divisor and handle zero before dividing
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0532

